1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,739
How do you turn Twitch streams into TikToks?

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:05,894
Don't convert one clip at a time.

3
00:00:05,894 --> 00:00:08,039
Paste the Twitch VOD into ClipMe.

4
00:00:08,039 --> 00:00:13,627
It ranks the whole stream and cuts vertical, captioned clips, ready to post on TikTok.

5
00:00:14,577 --> 00:00:17,332
Clip converters crop one clip you already found.

6
00:00:17,332 --> 00:00:20,145
ClipMe finds the moments across the whole stream.

7
00:00:21,095 --> 00:00:26,407
Every clip comes out captioned in 9:16, and Pro adds 4:5 and 1:1.

8
00:00:27,357 --> 00:00:32,946
It reads Twitch chat, and chat activity is one of the signals ClipMe uses to rank each moment.

9
00:00:33,897 --> 00:00:37,535
See how Twitch VODs become TikToks at clipme.com.

10
00:00:37,535 --> 00:00:39,614
Paste a VOD and try it free.

